  "notes": "Shadcn/Notion-like neutral UI. The off-white sidebar sits against a white main panel. Each feed has a small colored rounded square with a white initial letter as its favicon, and these give the page most of its color. Each group is a thin-bordered rounded panel (7px radius) with a light gray header strip. Row metadata is right-aligned ('5 articles · 9 minutes ago') next to a pencil edit icon. Fetch errors appear inline in red with an alert-circle icon, truncated with an ellipsis. Group action icons (add, rename, delete) appear in the header. The only saturated UI color is the blue primary Add split button. On the live page, the Edit Feed pencil opens a modal with Feed URL, Name, Group select, a Suspend toggle, Advanced Settings and an Unsubscribe action."
